{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-09_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-09","title":"操作暗箱","storyCode":"2-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"34d991acee0d9e9389fbe3cbcc5bd4da5991b7bb49bfc016ddd8723ec630cf6a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十一关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是最後一批追擊我們的整合運動了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"確保！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"確認安全無虞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"敵方的指揮官呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"——不在這批敵人裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"一直潛伏著......觀察著，尾隨著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"是想消磨我們的體力，等到穩操勝券後，再發動襲擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的敵人非常擅長發動偷襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這點，我們在切爾諾伯格時就領教過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時撤退——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒法確保撤退路線的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們破壞建築物來封鎖路口，我們就危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——立刻偵查其他的路線！越隱蔽越好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，四點鐘方向，那個向下方街道移動的階梯如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡可不好走哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！羅德島！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是伏擊！小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續給我追。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓他們有任何喘息的機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"——貧民區......裡有一些被感染的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你能......照看他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"保護龍門是近衛局的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，並非是龍門公民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但龍門的感染者依然屬於龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒任何理由向你保證，但我會盡到我的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說過，以前也——"},{"type":"narration","text":"="},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們一直在做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——你知道我們找你的原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我想不出自己有什麼值得你們追緝的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得，也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"原因不在我，卻在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"——我的父親身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"————是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父親，是切爾諾伯格最著名的科學家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"同時，他也是切爾諾伯格重要的政治人物之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，你身上有著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也許沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們不能允許你落入整合運動之手。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，找到你們了，龍門近衛局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我和你們無冤無仇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"但我手上有一個很有意思的劇本哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"為了讓事情變得好玩起來，有必要讓你們參與其中呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我們開始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["碎骨"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
